                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Championships alone don’t tell the full story. Win rates reveal who could consistently convert opportunities into victories. Legends like Clark, Ascari, Fangio, and Hamilton demonstrated extraordinary race dominance across very different eras.' captured-sheet='Sheet 2' id='1' />
                </story-points>
