                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Longevity and podium frequency are measures of resilience. Raikkonen and Barrichello built massive careers defined by reliability, while Prost combined consistency with titles, proving that being on the podium regularly is as vital as outright wins.' captured-sheet='Sheet 3' id='1' />
