                  <story-point caption='Pole position is the purest expression of raw speed. Senna’s legendary qualifying laps, Hamilton’s modern-era records, and Clark’s precision all showcase drivers who mastered Saturdays and set the stage for Sunday success.' captured-sheet='Sheet 4' id='1' />
